      <p class="pcard__word">Next 02</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">AI suggestions</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">Suggest which constraints to relax when a schedule cannot be solved.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="pcard rv">
      <p class="pcard__word">Next 03</p>
      <h3 class="pcard__title">Teacher feedback</h3>
      <p class="pcard__text">A feedback module for teachers before schedules are finalised.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
